  "description": "To the outside world, Ji-Hun and Seon-Jae seem like ordinary classmates, but there is something unspoken binding them that no one else can see. Ji-Hun follows Seon-Jae’s every word without question, as if under some quiet, unbreakable command. Watching from the sidelines is Ki-Wung, who grows increasingly disturbed by the dynamic and tries to pull Ji-Hun out of Seon-Jae’s shadow. As the line between control and devotion begins to blur, Ji-Hun must decide whether he can truly break free from Seon-Jae’s grip or if he has already surrendered to it completely.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes 12 side story chapters.*",
